      "manifest": "app-notifications",
      "selector": "harness [data-surface-id=\"notifications-filters\"][data-variant=\"populated\"] (four chips All/Needs action/Unread/In progress; filter -> data-outcome=\"filtered\"). Real surface: the [data-conformance-id=\"notifications-filters\"] chip group.",
